  "summary": "python-webob vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that WebOb incorrectly handled certain URLs. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to control a redirect or forward\nto another URL. This issue was only addressed in Ubuntu 16.04 LTS and\nUbuntu 18.04 LTS. (CVE-2024-42353)\n\nCaleb Brown discovered that WebOb incorrectly handled certain URLs. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to control a redirect or forward\nto another URL. (CVE-2026-44889)",
